an on acyclic\nvalue constraints. It does not promote any live vault edge family. It only says\nwhich edge proposals must be stopped for schema governance and obstruction\nreview.","excerpt_sha256":"279f07413212e9f419c3da172c96b7a49c40913aca376fb5d586aba1ebaa415b","necessary_declaration_guard_in_T":true,"query_id":"Instance-not-ActualSourceFidelity","selected_in_T":false,"selector":"/voices/scientific_formal/boundary_conditions/0","source":{"definition_id":"cal.definition.constraint-cycle-safety-invariant","path":"evidence/migrations/cyberalchemy-v2-to-lab/candidates/0004-artifact-reconstruction-pipeline/layers/l1-semantic-repeatability/definitions/constraint-cycle-safety-invariant/v1/definition.json","sha256":"bf829b78c06764c34db536edd838cce4683716935ca0ec5bd9742f8d66e573fb","version_ref":"cal.definition.constraint-cycle-safety-invariant@1.0.0-candidate.1"},"start_character":0},{"actual_outcome_target_in_T":false,"clause_id":"CCS-012","end_character":316,"excerpt":"Value-cycle edge guard is not a contextuality theorem, not a spectral-presheaf\nchecker, not a ban on cyclic non-value relations, and not a ban on acyclic\nvalue constraints. It does not promote any live vault edge family. It only says\nwhich edge proposals must be stopped for schema governance and obstruction\nreview.","excerpt_sha256":"279f07413212e9f419c3da172c96b7a49c40913aca376fb5d586aba1ebaa415b","necessary_declaration_guard_in_T":true,"query_id":"Proposal-not-ActualAuthority","selected_in_T":false,"selector":"/voices/scientific_formal/boundary_conditions/0","source":{"definition_id":"cal.definition.constraint-cycle-safety-invariant","path":"evidence/migrations/cyberalchemy-v2-to-lab/candidates/0004-artifact-reconstruction-pipeline/layers/l1-semantic-repeatability/definitions/constraint-cycle-safety-invariant/v1/definition.json","sha256":"bf829b78c06764c34db536edd838cce4683716935ca0ec5bd9742f8d66e573fb","version_ref":"cal.definition.constraint-cycle-safety-invariant@1.0.0-candidate.1"},"start_chara